WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:03,040
Miss Liang, you are here

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,550
this is a woman

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,550
And she's a very beautiful woman

4
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,550
A bit interesting

5
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,550
This shopping mall looks particularly harmonious

6
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:12,710
Such a beautiful woman was not taken down

7
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:15,710
Everyone else is a little in awe of her Hello.

8
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:18,710
I am Liang Zhihan, a security officer from Jiangcheng Fu'an District

9
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,710
Now your vehicle is commandeered

10
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,710
Miss Liang, right?

11
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:25,450
Can you salute Brother Dong?

12
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,450
Brother Dong is very happy

13
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:29,700
But the words you say and the tone of your voice

14
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,150
Brother Dong doesn’t like it very much

15
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:34,500
This woman still thinks she is indifferent to money.

16
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,500
If you want to use someone else's car, just use it

17
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,500
Today is different from the past

18
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,500
I didn’t mean to steal money by saying this, sorry.

19
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,500
I made a mistake in my statement

20
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,600
May I ask what you call Lin Dong?

21
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,950
Mr. Lin

22
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:48,980
Can you please come here?

23
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,980
Let's talk, okay?
